<http://www.semantictafsir.com/resource/commentary/0.14/5/poetry/1> a st:Poetry ;
    rdfs:label "Poetry 1" ;
    dcterms:source "S001M/sure_1_section_0.11-0.16.xml#L370" ;
    st:hasText """أَكُفْرًا بَعْدَ رَدِّ الْمَوْتِ عَنِّي
وَبَعْدَ عَطَائِكَ الْمِائَةَ الرِّتَاعَا"""@ar .

<http://www.semantictafsir.com/resource/commentary/0.14/5/poetry/2> a st:Poetry ;
    rdfs:label "Poetry 2" ;
    dcterms:source "S001M/sure_1_section_0.11-0.16.xml#L376" ;
    st:hasText """فَإِنْ كَانَ هَذَا الْبُخْلُ مِنْكَ سَجِيَّةً
لَقَدْ كُنْتَ فِي طَوْلِي رَجَاءَكَ أَشْعَبَا"""@ar .

<http://www.semantictafsir.com/resource/commentary/0.14/5/poetry/3> a st:Poetry ;
    rdfs:label "Poetry 3" ;
    dcterms:source "S001M/sure_1_section_0.11-0.16.xml#L382" ;
    st:hasText """أَظُلَيْمَ إِنَّ مُصَابَكُمْ رَجُلا
أَهْدَى السَّلامَ تَحِيَّةً ظُلْمُ"""@ar .

