    st:hasTheme <http://www.semantictafsir.com/resource/theme/harakat>,
        <http://www.semantictafsir.com/resource/theme/sarfi> .

<http://www.semantictafsir.com/resource/commentary/1.12/1/segment/1/segment/3/segment/1> a st:Segment ;
